<title>AUSTRALIA: RALLYING-AUSTRALIA RALLY FIRST STAGE STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-AUSTRALIA RALLY FIRST STAGE STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading standings after</p>
<p>the 2-km (correct) opening stage of the Rally of Australia on</p>
<p>Friday:</p>
<p> 1. Carlos Sainz (Spain) Ford Escort Cosworth 1 minute 35 secs</p>
<p> 2 equal. Colin McRae (Britain) Subaru Impreza	  </p>
<p> 2 equal. Tommi Makinen (Finland) Mitsubishi Lancer</p>
<p> 2 equal. Kenneth Eriksson (Sweden) Subaru Impreza</p>
<p> 2 equal. Piero Liatti (Italy)	Subaru Impreza</p>
<p> 2 equal. Bruno Thiry (Belgium)  Ford Escort Cosworth  all 1:36</p>
</text>
